  "title": "file_wrappers: Initialize an unread value, check its return",
  "description": "We only call lz4_fill_out_buffer when we're already in a LZ4 frame,\nwhich means that LZ4F_getFrameInfo doesn't read the input, doesn't\nread the input size bytes, and always sets it to zero.\n\nInitialize it to make Coverity happy (CID 1641422), and assert that\nthe return value is zero. It will be if the decompression context\nis in the proper stage. Otherwise there's a coding error somewhere.",
